{title: Unite Into One}
{key: A}
{reviewed: true}

{section: Verse 1}
[A]Chase away the power of [D]Satan,
Far [A]away beyond the land and sea;
[A]Build for God a boundless [D]King[A]dom,
Giving [E7]joy and [A]liberty to all.

{section: Verse 2}
[E7]Come, ye people [A]all around the world, [D]let's unite into [E]one; [E7]
[A]Spreading forth the [E]glory of the [A]Father, [E]
And His [A]great [E]will for[E7]ever[A]more.

{section: Chorus}
[A]Unite, Unite, [D]let's unite [E]into [E7]one
[A]Bring about one [E]nation [A]uniting [E]all the [A]people of the [E7]world. [A]

{section: Verse 3}
Raise the white cross on our banner,
High upon Mt. Everest it waves;
In the blue Pacific waters,
Cleanse the sword that brought the victory.

{section: Verse 4}
Come, ye people all around the world, let's unite into one. Now
resolve to end the deep resentment, of the long centuries past.
Build a fortress to defend the peace,
On the great new heaven and new earth;

{section: Verse 5}
We will all sing 'Hallelujah,'
Safe within the bosom of the Lord.
Come, ye people all around the world, let's unite into one.
Share the joy and glory of Heaven, hidden so long from every eye.
